                "heading": "",
                "text": "Proof: a redacted sample report, your public write-ups and one referral who will vouch for your care with live systems."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "First skill to learn: a clearly scoped, fixed-price offer with a written scope and an agreed start and end."
              },
